      "width": 400,
      "height": 65,
      "text": "Relationships:\n• Device 1──0..* OtaDeployment (one device has many OTA attempts)\n• Firmware 1──0..* OtaDeployment (one firmware deployed many times)\n• Device.current_ota_id → OtaDeployment.id (active deployment reference)",
