      "y": 1480,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 155,
      "text": "Gauges (current values):\n  fleet_active_devices        — online device count\n  fleet_total_devices          — total registered count\n  fleet_ota_in_progress        — active OTA deployments\n\nCounters (cumulative):\n  fleet_ota_deployments_total{status} — per-status OTA count\n  fleet_mqtt_messages_published_total — MQTT out\n  fleet_mqtt_messages_received_total  — MQTT in\n\nHistogram:\n  fleet_api_request_latency_seconds{method,endpoint}\n    Buckets: 5ms, 10ms, 25ms, 50ms, 100ms, 250ms, 500ms, 1s, 2.5s, 5s, +Inf",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
