      "y": 1480,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 155,
      "text": "Prometheus scrape config:\n  Job: fleet-commander\n  Target: backend:8000/metrics/\n  Interval: 10s\n\nGrafana dashboard panels:\n  • Active Devices (stat)\n  • Total Devices (stat)\n  • OTA In Progress (stat)\n  • OTA Success Rate (stat %)\n  • API Latency P95 (graph)\n  • OTA Deployments by Status (pie)\n  • MQTT Throughput (graph)\n  • Device Uptime (bar gauge)\n\nAll panels auto-refresh from Prometheus.",
